import Miura.Kinematics

/-!
# Miura-ori

Formalization of the rigid-folding kinematics and in-plane Poisson's ratio of the Miura-ori
([SchenkGuest2013], [Wei2013]) and of the sign of the Poisson's ratio of finite patterns
([Lv2014]). See `Miura.Kinematics`.

The out-of-plane (bending) Poisson's ratio, and the claim of [Wei2013] that it is the opposite of
the in-plane one, need a model of facet bending and are not formalized.
-/
